    id: '5',
    slug: 'mindonut-premium-packaging',
    categorySlug: 'branding-product',
    title: 'Mindonut (Premium Packaging)',
    client: 'Mindonut',
    description: 'The bakery and donut culinary industry today demands product presentation that is not only hygienic but also capable of delivering a memorable unboxing experience for consumers. Mindonat\'s management set the challenge of designing and producing three new structural packaging variants: a Mailer Box, a Sliding Softbox (Sleeve-Drawer Box), and a Takeaway Box, with the main goal of elevating the aesthetic perception to be far more elegant, sturdy, and distinctly exclusive.\n\nSCOPE OF WORK\n\nIn this project, our work capability covered every stage from pre-production through to the final physical sample, as follows:\n\nDieline Structure Design: Creating a structurally precise cut-and-fold pattern (dieline), including a dedicated insert/grid slot to keep the product securely in place and prevent shifting during transport.\n\nLayout & Production Preview: Arranging the graphic layout, logo placement, decorative elements (donut/mahjong illustration patterns), and printed informational content (storage instructions, QR code, Halal logo) so that everything is precisely aligned on every fold surface.\n\nPhysical Mock-up Production: Producing a 1:1 scale physical sample using genuine materials to verify the mechanical strength of the fold structure before mass production.\n\nPremium Finishing: Applying a high-quality matte (doff) lamination layer to deliver a velvety soft-touch effect, reduce light reflection, and improve resistance to water or oil.\n\nDesign Aesthetic Approach: To achieve the requested elegant impression, we applied a high-aesthetic minimalist concept to the packaging\'s exterior (clean exterior), combined with a visual surprise on the inside (rich interior layout). This is clearly seen in the Mailer Box variant, which hides a full-color donut print behind its minimalist cover.\n\nDETAILED ANALYSIS OF PACKAGING PRODUCT VARIANTS\n\nVariant 1: Sliding Softbox (Sleeve-Drawer Packaging)\nThis variant is specifically designed to deliver an instant premium impression. The sliding mechanism provides an elegant opening transition.\n\nKey Feature: A transparent rectangular acetate window (clear window) on top of the outer sleeve, allowing the product\'s visual appeal to be seen without opening the box.\nGraphic Layout: The exterior design is dominated by a clean white base color with burgundy donut-illustration accents at strategic corners, creating a luxurious color harmony. The side panel features a value-proposition text such as "Quality is Priority."\nInternal Structure: The inner drawer is made from sturdy thick carton laminated with an oil-resistant coating, allowing it to slide out smoothly.\n\nVariant 2: Premium Mailer Box (House of Bomboloni Variant)\nDesigned as a gift/delivery box with a highly sturdy double-locking structure on the sides to protect soft-textured pastries such as bomboloni.\n\nInterior Visual Surprise: When closed, the box presents a clean, elegant look. Once opened, consumers are greeted with a high-definition print of an array of bomboloni in various flavors on the inner lid, complete with the exclusive "House of Bomboloni" typography and a luxurious white marble background pattern.\n\nMechanical Detail: The double-wall side construction provides extra protection against vertical impact during courier shipping.\n\nVariant 3: Takeaway Box & Custom Insert\nThis packaging is designed for practical carrying without the need for an additional plastic bag, making it ideal for bulk takeaway purchases.\n\nIntegrated Handle Structure: The packaging\'s roof design tapers into a solid, comfortable-to-grip structural handle in emerald green.\nBox Graphic Layout: Uses a minimalist thin-line grid pattern decorated with colorful traditional mahjong-tile illustration elements, reflecting the thematic identity of the related collaboration variant. The side panel includes reheating instructions and an interactive QR code.\nInsert Structure: Fitted with a die-cut paper insert featuring a precise 8-circle pattern (2x4 layout). This insert locks each pastry/donut in place so that the cream topping or sprinkles do not touch or get damaged against each other while being carried.\n\nTECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS & FINAL PRODUCTION RESULT\n\nRaw Material: Art Carton 310-360 gsm / Premium Ivory Paper (Food Grade) - sturdy, hygienic, food-safe, and resistant to warping.\nSurface Finishing: Matte Lamination (Doff Thermal Film) - glare-free, soft premium texture, resistant to oil splashes.\nCutting Method: Automatic die-cutting following a precise dieline pattern - 100% accurate folds, quick assembly, minimal tearing.\nSpecial Accent: 0.2mm Rigid PVC Acetate (for the Sliding Box) - high transparency, making the product look hygienic and appealing from the outside.\n\nCAPABILITY CONCLUSION\n\nThrough the successful execution of this Mindonat packaging project, we demonstrate superior competence in bridging packaging logistics functionality with a high level of visual art aesthetics. Our ability to translate creative concepts into precisely printed layouts on dieline structures of any complexity, together with flawless matte-lamination finishing application, makes us the best strategic partner for any culinary brand looking to level up into a leading, exclusive brand.',
    clientLogo: '/images/portfolio/branding-product/Mindonat/logo-mindonat-complex-design.png',
